      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MULLUM SIZZLE (3) recorded another strong performance last start when he battled on bravely to finish second over 1780m at this track. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Won't find this any harder and he can take care of this line-up. JEWEL REASON (1) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 4.5 metres from the winner in third over 1780m here. This is a nice drop in grade so she is sure to prove tough to beat. OUTRUNTHETIDE (2) did a good job in a resuming second from the back row. Fitter and draws well so could progress enough to win. GAIT EXPECTATIONS (5) is a two-year-old gelding from the Ben Battle yard on debut. Showed some ability when a minor placegetter in a recent trial. Has the right credentials to play a role.",
